        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:auto;color:#1f2937;\">\n  <div style=\"background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;\">\n    Secrets Rotation Watchdog &nbsp;•&nbsp; automated credential lifecycle notice\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-left:4px solid #DC2626;padding:14px 18px;background:#FEF2F2;\">\n  <span style=\"background:#DC2626;color:#fff;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;\">ACTION REQUIRED — 7 DAYS</span>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px;font-size:18px;\">Rotate <u>before {{ $json.expiry_date }}</u></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;\">This credential enters its final week. After {{ $json.expiry_date }},\n  authentication using it will <strong>fail</strong>. Do not wait for the expiry date.</p>\n  <ol style=\"font-size:14px;margin:0;padding-left:20px;\">\n    <li><strong>Today:</strong> generate the replacement credential</li>\n    <li><strong>Within 48h:</strong> deploy it to every consumer</li>\n    <li><strong>Then:</strong> verify consumers work — only afterwards revoke the old value</li>\n  </ol>\n</div>\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px;\">\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#6b7280;width:35%;\">Credential</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:8px;\"><strong>{{ $json.name }}</strong> ({{ $json.id }})</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#6b7280;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">{{ $json.type }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#6b7280;\">Owner</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">{{ $json.owner_email }}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#6b7280;\">Expiry date</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\"><strong>{{ $json.expiry_date }}</strong></td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#6b7280;\">Last rotated</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\">{{ $json.last_rotated }}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\">\n    Automated message from Secrets Rotation Watchdog • credential id {{ $json.id }} • do not reply.\n    If you have already rotated this credential, no further action is needed.</p>\n</div>",
